OL,3,GNEWSAMissing donkey leaves autistic    
OL,4,Aboy, 3, heartbroken                    
OL,6,FA three-year-old autistic boy has been 
OL,7,Fleft "absolutely heartbroken" after a  
OL,8,Fbaby donkey he bonded with from birth  
OL,9,Fdisappeared from his family's farm in  
OL,10,FDerbyshire.                            
OL,12,F"He's gone down, his donkey isn't there
OL,13,Fand he is absolutely heartbroken," said
OL,14,Fhis mother, Niamh.                     
OL,16,FThe foal, named Gabriel, vanished      
OL,17,Fovernight on Thursday and has not been 
OL,18,Fseen since at the farm near Darley     
OL,19,FAbbey, despite searches, social media  
OL,20,Fappeals and a #500 reward.             
